  "Lines changed is measured against the dataset's reference solution, not against what an honest model would write, so a big number can mean a rewrite rather than a big backdoor.",
  "Size and writer are tangled: o3-mini's backdoors change the most lines and are the easiest to catch (P11). This figure alone can't say which one drives the other."
